From: Om Swami <reach.oms2004@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:44:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(lnv2): refund keys held by an external signer

`LightningClientInit::refund_keys` lets an external signer hold the refund
keys of outgoing contracts. The signer then authorises gateways to pay,
signs refunds through the client's transaction signer, and a refund it
does not sign yet is retried with a growing delay instead of failing.
